WEBVTT

01:37.729 --> 01:43.080
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.130 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.690 --> 01:45.900
[Episode 15]

01:46.759 --> 01:48.840
From the Hound Pit
in the west of the county

01:48.840 --> 01:50.440
to Yulu Pavilion in the east,

01:50.840 --> 01:53.430
Xinghua Alley is the only route.

01:53.430 --> 01:55.039
Gong Le knew exactly

01:55.350 --> 01:56.150
when Zhe Shan

01:56.400 --> 01:57.800
came and went every time.

01:58.479 --> 02:00.480
The methods used
in the two throat-crushing cases

02:00.480 --> 02:02.230
were remarkably similar.

02:03.200 --> 02:04.640
The Divine Constable Tally is here.

02:04.640 --> 02:06.590
Listen carefully, suspects.

02:06.680 --> 02:08.080
If you tell the truth now,

02:08.090 --> 02:09.630
you can still keep some dignity.

02:09.630 --> 02:11.350
But if you lie,

02:11.680 --> 02:13.030
let's see if your heads are harder

02:13.030 --> 02:14.370
than the execution blade

02:14.370 --> 02:15.900
beside the Shangfang Drum.

02:16.120 --> 02:16.980
Sound the drum.

02:17.430 --> 02:18.340
Start the trial!

02:18.340 --> 02:20.550
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

02:28.120 --> 02:28.980
Second Master.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.240
Although the deceased, Ji Ada, drowned,

02:34.240 --> 02:35.560
the real cause of death

02:35.680 --> 02:37.940
was a beast's teeth crushing his throat.

02:38.680 --> 02:40.190
He was murdered.

02:40.590 --> 02:43.150
And the murderer is in this courtyard.

02:43.840 --> 02:44.800
Ji Ada

02:45.360 --> 02:47.690
was bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

02:49.010 --> 02:50.980
And he wasn't the only one.

02:51.470 --> 02:54.130
There was also Zhe Shan,
the guard of Ji Mansion.

02:55.000 --> 02:55.800
Zhe Shan?

02:55.870 --> 02:56.550
Wasn't he

02:56.579 --> 02:58.070
bitten to death by the wolf demon

02:58.070 --> 02:59.600
controlled by Xia Jiuying?

03:00.470 --> 03:01.370
The real killer

03:01.400 --> 03:02.840
who put these two to death

03:03.590 --> 03:05.000
is not Xia Jiuying,

03:05.560 --> 03:07.000
but someone else.

03:12.870 --> 03:15.630
And those are the young master
of the Gong family,

03:16.150 --> 03:16.960
Gong Le,

03:18.000 --> 03:18.800
and

03:20.240 --> 03:21.560
Old Madam Gong,

03:22.360 --> 03:23.240
Lady Wang.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.000
I don't understand.

03:31.150 --> 03:32.000
How did these two

03:32.000 --> 03:33.840
make the dog kill?

03:34.360 --> 03:35.310
As far as I know,

03:35.840 --> 03:36.780
Black Silk Leopard usually

03:36.780 --> 03:38.280
only takes orders from Gong Sihai.

03:38.280 --> 03:39.910
Lord Situ, do you believe

03:40.240 --> 03:42.310
that I can also control
Black Silk Leopard?

03:42.310 --> 03:42.970
Well...

03:43.000 --> 03:44.160
Bring it over.

03:47.030 --> 03:47.910
Pour it in.

04:11.030 --> 04:11.800
Alright.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.560
Lord Situ, please

04:14.960 --> 04:16.560
step in front of the dog cage.

04:42.270 --> 04:43.070
What...

04:43.390 --> 04:45.040
What on earth is going on?

04:45.270 --> 04:47.060
Reda, the steward of the Gong Mansion,

04:47.060 --> 04:48.590
lives in this side room.

04:48.870 --> 04:50.240
He loves to drink.

04:50.270 --> 04:52.560
This wine was taken from his room.

04:52.560 --> 04:54.870
The deserted courtyard
connected to this backyard

04:54.870 --> 04:55.880
was where Gong Sihai

04:55.880 --> 04:57.600
put Old Madam Gong under house arrest.

04:57.600 --> 04:59.240
And the bowl of rice porridge just now

04:59.240 --> 05:00.680
was Old Madam Gong's

05:00.680 --> 05:02.390
three meals a day.

05:02.680 --> 05:03.810
Lady Wang

05:04.560 --> 05:05.800
used wine

05:06.360 --> 05:07.480
and rice porridge,

05:07.830 --> 05:09.950
two easily accessible things,

05:10.390 --> 05:13.510
to make Black Silk Leopard kill.

05:15.600 --> 05:18.040
Mixing the wine and rice porridge?

05:18.750 --> 05:20.200
I... I understand.

05:20.220 --> 05:21.600
Dogs have very sharp noses.

05:21.600 --> 05:22.360
Black Silk Leopard

05:22.360 --> 05:24.240
hates this scent.

05:24.260 --> 05:26.660
Lady Wang
used the dog's keen sense of smell

05:26.750 --> 05:28.040
to train Black Silk Leopard

05:28.040 --> 05:29.450
to hate

05:29.480 --> 05:30.560
this unique scent.

05:30.830 --> 05:32.230
With repeated training

05:32.260 --> 05:33.260
and stimulation,

05:33.560 --> 05:34.630
over time,

05:34.950 --> 05:36.159
once Black Silk Leopard

05:36.159 --> 05:38.240
smells this scent on someone,

05:39.240 --> 05:41.300
it will attack on its own.

05:43.600 --> 05:46.070
Old Madam Gong was confined
to the mansion all year round.

05:46.070 --> 05:47.590
Naturally, she didn't know

05:47.590 --> 05:48.540
trivial details

05:48.560 --> 05:49.680
like boxers using rice water

05:49.680 --> 05:51.190
to soak their cloth strips.

05:51.190 --> 05:52.540
But Gong Le,

05:52.600 --> 05:54.830
who frequently visited the Hound Pit
to see his friend,

05:54.830 --> 05:56.340
noticed it

05:56.430 --> 05:57.750
and kept that in mind.

06:06.800 --> 06:08.510
Every time Zhe Shan won a bout,

06:08.600 --> 06:10.830
he would go to Yulu Hall
for some entertainment.

06:10.830 --> 06:12.830
His route took him through Xinghua Alley,

06:12.830 --> 06:14.800
right outside Gong Le's window.

06:19.040 --> 06:21.030
He smelled of rice water,

06:21.190 --> 06:23.190
coupled with the stench of alcohol.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.500
This undoubtedly made him

06:25.500 --> 06:28.450
a perfect target for Black Silk Leopard.

07:43.159 --> 07:44.430
Setting the dog to kill

07:44.800 --> 07:46.530
and hiding the body on the spot.

07:46.800 --> 07:49.240
Mingling is currently in its rainy season.

07:50.070 --> 07:51.950
With just one heavy rain,

07:52.390 --> 07:53.600
Zhe Shan's body

07:53.870 --> 07:55.830
would disappear without a trace

07:56.360 --> 07:57.120
and turn up

07:57.140 --> 07:58.900
in the Yan River 20 li away.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.830
But My Lord,

08:02.800 --> 08:03.600
my brother

08:03.630 --> 08:05.390
wasn't like those boxers

08:05.430 --> 08:07.000
who have rice water on their hands
every day.

08:07.000 --> 08:07.790
How could he

08:07.820 --> 08:10.080
be bitten to death by Black Silk Leopard?

08:14.040 --> 08:15.560
Old Madam Gong

08:15.950 --> 08:17.360
should also have a pair of

08:18.000 --> 08:19.510
agate walnuts.

08:20.830 --> 08:22.960
Just as she used scent to train the dog,

08:23.040 --> 08:23.850
she used

08:23.880 --> 08:24.910
the unique sound

08:24.930 --> 08:27.160
of the agate walnuts knocking together.

08:27.160 --> 08:29.060
She covered Black Silk Leopard's eyes,

08:29.060 --> 08:32.429
knocked the walnuts together,
then attacked it with her hairpin.

08:32.429 --> 08:33.669
After repeating this over and over,

08:33.669 --> 08:35.750
Black Silk Leopard

08:36.080 --> 08:38.200
would automatically attack

08:38.200 --> 08:40.120
whoever made that sound.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.010
That was

08:41.030 --> 08:43.360
Ji Ada when he was
walking down the street.

08:46.870 --> 08:48.840
The best way for the killer
to destroy the evidence

08:48.840 --> 08:50.120
was to throw it

08:50.440 --> 08:51.610
into the vast waters

08:51.720 --> 08:53.750
of Cui Lake.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.720
It would be so hard

08:58.960 --> 09:00.030
to recover 2 tiny walnuts

09:00.030 --> 09:01.240
from the water.

09:01.440 --> 09:02.600
Without physical evidence,

09:02.600 --> 09:03.840
it will be difficult to convict him.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.200
Bring up the stone slab!

09:12.960 --> 09:13.810
Isn't this

09:13.960 --> 09:16.360
the stone slab covering the flood channel?

09:17.360 --> 09:19.090
Everyone, look at these marks.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.510
After the murders,

09:29.840 --> 09:31.790
Gong Le used this crowbar

09:31.960 --> 09:33.960
to pry open the stone slab
over the flood channel

09:33.960 --> 09:35.750
and hide Zhe Shan's and Ji Ada's bodies

09:35.750 --> 09:36.750
inside.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.240
This crowbar...

09:46.270 --> 09:47.360
Young Master Gong Le,

09:47.360 --> 09:50.090
you left it deliberately in the room,
didn't you?

10:19.240 --> 10:20.410
I had a dog

10:20.430 --> 10:21.790
bite his neck off

10:24.960 --> 10:27.090
instead of subjecting him to torture,

10:27.550 --> 10:29.480
flaying him, and eating his flesh.

10:30.870 --> 10:33.080
That was the greatest mercy
I could show him!

10:33.080 --> 10:33.910
Gong Le...

10:34.790 --> 10:36.000
Pay for my brother's life!

10:36.000 --> 10:36.390
Second Master!

10:36.390 --> 10:38.870
-Pay for my brother's life!
-Second Master, calm down!

10:38.870 --> 10:39.630
Let go!

10:39.630 --> 10:40.440
Let go!

10:41.000 --> 10:43.480
Gong Le, are you pleading guilty?

10:43.630 --> 10:45.440
Those two were both killed by me.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.000
As for the method,

10:49.440 --> 10:51.030
it was exactly the same as what

10:51.030 --> 10:52.830
the Divine Constable just said.

10:52.960 --> 10:54.580
I had to ensure the training was effective

10:54.580 --> 10:55.440
and foolproof.

10:56.360 --> 10:57.150
Zhe Shan

10:58.870 --> 11:01.000
was just a guinea pig.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.550
My real targets

11:05.080 --> 11:06.870
were the ones who had the Gong family
massacred back then—

11:06.870 --> 11:08.960
Qiu Sihai and Ji Ada!

11:10.080 --> 11:10.870
So,

11:11.390 --> 11:12.320
if the Divine Constable Bureau hadn't

11:12.320 --> 11:13.630
captured Qiu Sihai,

11:14.480 --> 11:17.010
he would probably have died
by your hands too.

11:17.750 --> 11:18.910
I was just gambling.

11:20.910 --> 11:21.720
Gambling?

11:22.550 --> 11:24.630
If Qiu Sihai dies by my hands,

11:25.200 --> 11:26.550
there will be no witnesses left.

11:26.550 --> 11:28.200
Then the masterminds behind him,

11:28.200 --> 11:29.440
the real culprits,

11:30.670 --> 11:32.200
those high officials and nobles,

11:32.200 --> 11:34.390
cannot be uprooted!

11:35.270 --> 11:37.150
And the monstrous injustice
suffered by the Gong family

11:37.150 --> 11:38.910
will never see the light of day!

11:45.870 --> 11:47.030
I bet that

11:49.770 --> 11:52.030
the lords of the Divine Constable Bureau

11:52.440 --> 11:54.200
are good officials
who exonerate the innocent,

11:54.200 --> 11:57.060
suppress violence, punish evil,
and promote good,

11:58.000 --> 11:59.600
and that you can bring true justice

11:59.600 --> 12:01.200
to us innocent people!

12:10.080 --> 12:11.670
Divine Constable, what you just said

12:11.670 --> 12:12.570
is all true!

12:12.590 --> 12:14.520
I have nothing to say in my defense!

12:16.120 --> 12:16.870
But my grandmother

12:16.870 --> 12:18.390
only followed the method I taught her

12:18.390 --> 12:19.630
to train Black Silk Leopard.

12:19.630 --> 12:20.690
She knew absolutely nothing

12:20.690 --> 12:21.670
about the murder plan.

12:21.670 --> 12:22.960
My Lords, please,

12:23.000 --> 12:25.200
considering my grandmother's old age,

12:27.480 --> 12:28.550
show mercy!

12:41.360 --> 12:42.440
Young Master Gong.

12:43.750 --> 12:46.750
To protect your grandmother,

12:47.790 --> 12:50.050
you chose to take all the blame yourself.

12:50.150 --> 12:52.120
To clear Xia Jiuying's name,

12:52.750 --> 12:54.810
you deliberately kept the evidence.

12:55.480 --> 12:57.340
You want to save your grandmother

12:57.440 --> 12:58.750
and Xia Jiuying.

12:59.870 --> 13:02.360
But the only person
you never thought of saving

13:02.360 --> 13:03.600
is yourself.

13:04.720 --> 13:05.510
I, Gong Le,

13:07.670 --> 13:09.270
have no regrets in this life.

13:30.790 --> 13:31.850
Young Master Gong.

13:33.240 --> 13:34.240
Old Madam Gong.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.240
This case

13:36.790 --> 13:38.200
is not over yet.

13:40.790 --> 13:41.910
Get up first.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.030
Gong Le,

13:49.240 --> 13:50.040
let me ask you.

13:50.630 --> 13:52.040
You killed Ji Ada

13:52.200 --> 13:54.330
on the second day of this month, right?

13:54.390 --> 13:55.720
Yes, it was that day.

13:56.440 --> 13:58.200
That night,
a fire broke out at the Hound Pit.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.870
Ji Ada was rushing back to his mansion

13:59.870 --> 14:00.960
when I intercepted and killed him.

14:00.960 --> 14:02.250
Fire!

14:02.440 --> 14:03.550
Put out the fire!

14:03.550 --> 14:04.080
Hurry!

14:04.100 --> 14:04.860
Oh no.

14:56.480 --> 14:57.790
That's strange.

14:58.600 --> 15:00.240
You killed him
on the second day of the month,

15:00.240 --> 15:01.850
but on the third day,

15:02.000 --> 15:03.980
Mr. Ji invited us

15:04.000 --> 15:05.510
to drink at Tingchao Boat.

15:05.630 --> 15:06.820
That's impossible.

15:09.240 --> 15:10.210
Could it be that

15:10.630 --> 15:11.600
on that day,

15:12.480 --> 15:14.410
the one who fell from Tingchao Boat

15:15.000 --> 15:16.630
was Mr. Ji's ghost?

15:17.440 --> 15:18.360
On the third day,

15:18.360 --> 15:20.030
Ji Ada fell into the sea
from Tingchao Boat.

15:20.030 --> 15:21.270
The four of us saw it with our own eyes.

15:21.270 --> 15:22.440
We couldn't be wrong.

15:22.440 --> 15:23.570
That's impossible.

15:23.960 --> 15:24.750
I clearly...

15:24.750 --> 15:25.480
Gong Le,

15:26.000 --> 15:28.000
are you sure
the person you killed that night

15:28.000 --> 15:29.120
was Ji Ada?

15:43.750 --> 15:44.550
That night,

15:45.200 --> 15:46.530
the alley was very dark.

15:48.240 --> 15:49.030
I...

15:49.390 --> 15:50.030
I...

15:50.030 --> 15:51.390
You did kill someone.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.840
But the one who got killed was not Ji Ada.

15:53.840 --> 15:55.120
It was his double,

15:55.630 --> 15:57.200
and this is the corpse.

16:01.750 --> 16:02.600
His double?

16:08.360 --> 16:10.320
What a switch.

16:11.080 --> 16:12.000
Am I right,

16:13.270 --> 16:14.200
Mr. Ji?

16:18.360 --> 16:19.840
I really don't know

16:20.200 --> 16:21.870
what you are talking about, My Lord.

16:21.870 --> 16:22.960
Mr. Ji?

16:23.240 --> 16:23.870
Well...

16:23.870 --> 16:25.000
My Lord, you mean...

16:25.360 --> 16:26.440
he is Ji Ada?

16:27.630 --> 16:28.440
Ji Ada?

16:28.760 --> 16:30.750
Does that mean the one I killed was...

16:30.750 --> 16:31.550
Ji Er?

16:31.840 --> 16:33.720
There was never any Ji Er.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.670
From the very beginning,

16:35.670 --> 16:37.000
it was all Ji Ada

16:37.020 --> 16:38.080
using a double

16:38.100 --> 16:39.910
to fool the world!

16:46.030 --> 16:50.000
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

16:48.510 --> 16:49.570
Still pretending?

16:50.200 --> 16:52.300
You colluded with Gong Sihai

16:52.550 --> 16:54.390
to amass a lot of ill-gotten wealth.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.990
You were worried that one day

16:56.030 --> 16:57.200
your crimes would be exposed.

16:57.200 --> 16:58.000
So,

16:58.150 --> 16:59.750
you prepared a double.

17:00.080 --> 17:01.600
With just a little disguise,

17:01.600 --> 17:03.390
he could look exactly like you,

17:03.610 --> 17:04.359
just like

17:04.750 --> 17:06.349
your twin brother.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.680
You claimed that Ji Er was in poor health

17:08.680 --> 17:09.400
and usually

17:09.430 --> 17:10.829
never left the house.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.970
-So, hardly anyone remembers
-Let's go back, Second Master.

17:11.970 --> 17:13.160
what he looks like.

17:13.160 --> 17:14.960
The elder brother
does all kinds of evil things,

17:14.960 --> 17:16.000
while the younger

17:16.160 --> 17:17.650
-is a good man.
-Go back and rest, Second Master.

17:17.650 --> 17:18.880
That's the impression

17:18.880 --> 17:19.920
the Ji brothers

17:19.960 --> 17:21.349
have given everyone.

17:21.589 --> 17:23.349
When the Divine Constable Bureau
arrived at the Hound Pit,

17:23.349 --> 17:25.030
you knew you were in big trouble.

17:25.030 --> 17:25.829
So,

17:25.960 --> 17:27.829
late at night on the second day,
you disguised yourself as Ji Er

17:27.829 --> 17:29.250
and set the place on fire.

17:29.680 --> 17:30.640
Go, go.

17:30.750 --> 17:31.550
Hurry up and go.

17:31.550 --> 17:33.220
You disguised yourself as Ji Er,

17:33.220 --> 17:35.830
so Ji Er naturally
had to disguise himself as you,

17:35.830 --> 17:36.640
Mr. Ji.

17:37.310 --> 17:38.110
I guess

17:38.750 --> 17:39.550
that night,

17:39.830 --> 17:41.880
you were already prepared

17:42.000 --> 17:44.000
to kill your double.

17:49.260 --> 17:50.300
Where did he go?

17:50.510 --> 17:51.310
You, that way!

17:51.330 --> 17:52.450
You two, that way!

17:52.480 --> 17:52.960
Yes!

17:52.960 --> 17:53.270
Let's go!

17:53.270 --> 17:54.160
Stop chasing!

17:55.750 --> 17:56.800
S-Stop chasing.

17:57.000 --> 17:58.350
Let that child go.

17:58.350 --> 17:59.380
Second Master!

17:59.880 --> 18:00.960
You set the fire,

18:00.960 --> 18:02.070
and you let the person go.

18:02.070 --> 18:03.400
Think about
how you're going to explain this

18:03.400 --> 18:05.130
to the Master when you get back!

18:05.790 --> 18:06.790
Stop chasing...

18:16.680 --> 18:17.720
Unfortunately,

18:17.880 --> 18:19.480
man proposes, God disposes.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.240
You didn't expect

18:22.750 --> 18:23.550
Gong Le

18:24.030 --> 18:26.170
to become the biggest flaw

18:26.400 --> 18:27.790
in your entire plan.

19:53.440 --> 19:54.470
Idiot.

20:15.440 --> 20:17.480
I couldn't figure it out at first either.

20:17.480 --> 20:19.440
If a crushed throat can kill him,

20:19.830 --> 20:21.400
why use a stone to smash him?

20:22.230 --> 20:25.640
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

20:22.720 --> 20:23.510
Gong Le.

20:24.750 --> 20:25.550
I'm afraid

20:26.160 --> 20:27.960
you never expected

20:28.480 --> 20:29.510
that the person you went

20:29.510 --> 20:30.830
to such lengths to kill

20:31.400 --> 20:34.060
was actually helping you
carry out the killing.

20:41.440 --> 20:43.100
The man who was Ji Er at the time

20:43.350 --> 20:45.160
and is now Mr. Ji

20:45.400 --> 20:46.260
naturally knew about

20:46.260 --> 20:48.110
Gong Le's plan to move the body by water.

20:46.410 --> 20:51.950
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

20:48.750 --> 20:49.590
He knew

20:50.200 --> 20:52.160
the body
would go from the river to the sea.

20:52.160 --> 20:52.960
So,

20:53.590 --> 20:55.160
he went with the flow.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.400
You put on the same clothes

20:57.400 --> 20:58.680
as the double from last night,

20:58.680 --> 21:00.350
threw a big celebration banquet,

21:00.350 --> 21:01.400
and put on a good show

21:01.400 --> 21:03.440
of falling into the sea to resist arrest.

21:03.440 --> 21:05.030
The purpose was

21:05.240 --> 21:06.190
to make the four of us

21:06.190 --> 21:08.510
witnesses to your death.

21:24.030 --> 21:24.890
Second Master.

21:25.830 --> 21:26.690
Second Master.

21:26.960 --> 21:29.090
The medicine is ready, Second Master.

21:33.440 --> 21:35.900
Second Master,
it's time for your medicine.

21:41.830 --> 21:43.400
Why are you sweating so much?

21:43.400 --> 21:44.800
Did you have a nightmare?

21:46.440 --> 21:47.370
The medicine...

21:51.240 --> 21:52.100
Second Master!

21:52.240 --> 21:53.100
Second Master!

21:53.160 --> 21:54.000
Second Master!

21:54.000 --> 21:55.240
Bad news! Bad news!

21:56.240 --> 21:57.480
B-Bad news.

21:57.480 --> 21:58.680
Something terrible has happened!

21:58.680 --> 22:00.240
Why are you panicking?

22:00.240 --> 22:01.000
Master...

22:01.000 --> 22:01.790
Master...

22:02.160 --> 22:03.560
Master fell into the sea!

22:04.790 --> 22:06.920
Thus, Ji Ada,

22:06.920 --> 22:08.720
who had done nothing but evil,

22:08.830 --> 22:10.030
finally met his end.

22:09.900 --> 22:12.560
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

22:10.590 --> 22:12.720
Only Ji Er, the good brother,

22:13.270 --> 22:15.510
remained, innocent and blameless.

22:16.680 --> 22:17.980
Your baseless fantasies

22:17.980 --> 22:20.030
and speculations just now

22:20.030 --> 22:21.310
are truly

22:21.510 --> 22:23.110
absurd.

22:23.680 --> 22:26.270
Even if Gong Le killed the wrong person,

22:26.750 --> 22:28.270
that doesn't prove

22:29.440 --> 22:31.070
that the one lying here

22:32.550 --> 22:33.920
is not my brother.

22:34.270 --> 22:36.030
The body is severely decomposed,

22:36.030 --> 22:37.000
and the two possible times of death

22:37.000 --> 22:38.310
are only half a day apart.

22:38.310 --> 22:39.440
It is indeed impossible to determine

22:39.440 --> 22:40.970
that the deceased is Ji Ada.

22:42.070 --> 22:43.240
As for his double,

22:43.240 --> 22:44.970
that is even more nonsensical.

22:45.310 --> 22:46.870
We twin brothers of the Ji family

22:46.870 --> 22:49.240
are the cousins of Princess Ding.

22:49.310 --> 22:51.440
Everyone in Mingling knows this.

22:51.550 --> 22:53.960
My brother and I

22:55.070 --> 22:56.960
were born from the same womb.

22:57.270 --> 22:58.650
It is well-documented

22:59.030 --> 23:00.310
and verifiable.

23:01.750 --> 23:03.350
How can you say it's a fake?

23:03.510 --> 23:05.440
I did ask the bureau

23:05.480 --> 23:06.920
to investigate

23:06.920 --> 23:08.480
you two brothers.

23:08.750 --> 23:10.070
The Ji family originated

23:10.070 --> 23:11.550
in Dinghai, Yuezhou,

23:11.960 --> 23:14.110
and has made a living by fishing
for generations.

23:14.110 --> 23:15.710
In the fifth year of Hongyun,

23:15.960 --> 23:17.480
a great plague struck Yuezhou,

23:17.480 --> 23:18.920
and your clan members were scattered.

23:18.920 --> 23:21.640
You two brothers became beggars

23:21.720 --> 23:23.310
and were never heard from again.

23:23.310 --> 23:25.240
The Mingling County Records states

23:25.240 --> 23:26.960
that in the 20th year of Hongyun,

23:26.960 --> 23:29.020
the Ji brothers settled in Mingling.

23:29.160 --> 23:31.350
Later, you reunited with Princess Ding

23:31.350 --> 23:32.610
and made your fortune.

23:33.960 --> 23:35.030
But I guess

23:35.240 --> 23:36.440
the real Ji Er

23:36.640 --> 23:37.900
must have died long ago

23:37.910 --> 23:39.350
during that wandering journey.

23:39.350 --> 23:41.550
The one who settled in Mingling with you

23:41.640 --> 23:43.640
was this double.

23:43.640 --> 23:44.480
Absurd!

23:48.550 --> 23:50.070
What you just said

23:50.720 --> 23:51.350
is nothing but

23:51.350 --> 23:53.160
your speculation.

23:53.160 --> 23:53.830
Fine.

23:54.880 --> 23:56.350
You want evidence?

23:56.640 --> 23:58.350
Then I will give you evidence.

23:58.880 --> 24:00.030
The real Ji Er

24:00.160 --> 24:01.350
is chronically ill,

24:01.720 --> 24:04.050
so he always stays indoors to recuperate.

24:04.160 --> 24:06.420
It's easy for a person to fake an illness.

24:07.350 --> 24:09.270
But if you want to change your complexion

24:09.270 --> 24:10.760
and truly present

24:10.780 --> 24:11.980
a sickly appearance,

24:12.270 --> 24:13.470
it's very difficult.

24:13.750 --> 24:15.880
If you don't believe me,

24:16.070 --> 24:17.640
you can find a doctor

24:17.960 --> 24:19.640
to check my pulse

24:20.350 --> 24:21.480
and see if my illness

24:21.880 --> 24:22.880
is real

24:23.160 --> 24:24.310
or fake.

24:28.310 --> 24:30.160
It only takes one trick
to fake your illness.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.750
It comes and goes

24:31.750 --> 24:33.640
in the snap of a finger.

24:34.720 --> 24:36.030
Ji Er's pulmonary tuberculosis

24:36.030 --> 24:37.920
is caused by cold invading
the Shaoyang meridian.

24:37.920 --> 24:39.460
There is an acupoint in the human body

24:39.460 --> 24:40.270
called Dazhui,

24:40.270 --> 24:41.550
which lies along the Governing Vessel

24:41.550 --> 24:43.950
and governs all the body's yang meridians.

24:44.350 --> 24:45.600
If a needle is used

24:45.750 --> 24:47.030
to seal this acupoint,

24:47.720 --> 24:50.120
the flow of qi and blood
will be obstructed,

24:50.160 --> 24:51.510
producing

24:51.920 --> 24:53.920
the sickly appearance you see here.

25:36.720 --> 25:38.310
Even his lips have turned red.

25:38.310 --> 25:40.030
So you can fake an illness like this?

25:40.030 --> 25:40.830
Ji Ada!

25:41.030 --> 25:42.160
What else do you have to say?

25:42.070 --> 25:45.240
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

25:43.270 --> 25:45.240
Whether I am Ji Er

25:45.440 --> 25:46.920
or Ji Ada,

25:47.550 --> 25:48.830
it doesn't matter.

25:49.110 --> 25:50.270
Divine Constable Li!

25:50.270 --> 25:52.350
You insist that I faked my death
to escape punishment.

25:52.350 --> 25:53.550
Then you must first

25:53.580 --> 25:55.060
convict me of a crime!

25:55.240 --> 25:56.350
Let me ask you!

25:57.070 --> 25:58.960
You said the Ji family
had been reselling government salt.

25:58.960 --> 25:59.600
Besides a few

25:59.600 --> 26:01.110
unfounded confessions,

26:01.110 --> 26:02.350
do you have any solid evidence?

26:02.350 --> 26:04.350
You have to show it to everyone

26:02.390 --> 26:04.270
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

26:04.350 --> 26:07.640
so that I have no choice but to concede,

26:07.640 --> 26:08.550
right?

26:12.880 --> 26:14.920
After the silver needles were pulled out,

26:14.920 --> 26:16.920
your voice became much louder.

26:17.480 --> 26:18.270
Mr. Ji,

26:18.290 --> 26:19.350
that day,

26:19.550 --> 26:21.440
you set fire to your own Hound Pit

26:21.440 --> 26:22.970
and burned it to the ground.

26:23.350 --> 26:24.160
It shouldn't just be

26:24.160 --> 26:26.290
because you wanted to be a good person.

26:32.030 --> 26:32.830
Ji Ada.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.190
We have already found bricks made of salt

26:34.190 --> 26:35.830
in your Hound Pit!

26:37.750 --> 26:38.680
Let me tell you.

26:39.310 --> 26:41.160
It took me a lot of effort to find them.

26:41.160 --> 26:42.560
I almost choked to death!

26:45.680 --> 26:46.830
I didn't expect

26:47.440 --> 26:48.960
you to actually find it.

26:49.160 --> 26:49.960
Yan,

26:50.310 --> 26:51.880
you look careless, but you are actually

26:51.880 --> 26:53.160
meticulous and observant.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.030
Usually, because

26:54.030 --> 26:54.880
you guys are around,

26:54.880 --> 26:56.680
I am too lazy to use my brain.

26:56.920 --> 26:57.720
But when it comes to things

26:57.720 --> 26:59.110
that you can't solve,

26:59.110 --> 26:59.970
I, Yan,

26:59.990 --> 27:01.040
will step forward

27:01.060 --> 27:02.070
and do my part.

27:02.070 --> 27:02.830
As expected,

27:03.160 --> 27:05.240
you hid the account books

27:05.440 --> 27:07.680
for reselling government salt
in the Hound Pit.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.830
You burned down the Hound Pit

27:08.830 --> 27:09.440
just to

27:09.470 --> 27:11.350
destroy the evidence.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.640
How you seized the government salt,

27:13.640 --> 27:15.650
how you sold it,
and how you split the proceeds—

27:15.650 --> 27:16.550
they're

27:16.550 --> 27:17.550
all recorded here

27:17.680 --> 27:19.640
in detail.

27:19.720 --> 27:20.550
Ji Ada,

27:21.640 --> 27:23.270
what else do you have to say?

27:24.880 --> 27:25.680
My Lord.

27:37.070 --> 27:38.790
If it weren't for you little brat

27:38.790 --> 27:39.720
causing trouble

27:39.730 --> 27:40.920
and ruining my plan,

27:41.240 --> 27:42.510
the Divine Constable Bureau

27:42.510 --> 27:44.480
would never have traced it back to me!

27:44.480 --> 27:45.750
But so what?

27:46.070 --> 27:47.800
As long as His Highness Prince Ding

27:47.800 --> 27:49.750
is still a prince of the Great Shi,

27:50.030 --> 27:52.270
and my cousin is still Princess Ding,

27:52.300 --> 27:53.780
what can you rats

27:53.880 --> 27:55.480
do to me?

27:59.880 --> 28:01.880
Even if I die,

28:02.440 --> 28:03.370
the First Prince

28:03.750 --> 28:05.310
will never let you off.

28:10.030 --> 28:11.440
So, Mr. Ji, are you saying

28:12.750 --> 28:14.550
that reselling government salt

28:15.160 --> 28:17.320
was the First Prince's idea?

28:18.920 --> 28:19.750
Nonsense!

28:21.340 --> 28:23.790
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

28:21.510 --> 28:22.920
I never said that.

28:30.400 --> 28:31.160
Ji Ada.

28:31.160 --> 28:31.880
What is it?

28:39.160 --> 28:40.560
-Master.
-Grandmother!

28:42.110 --> 28:42.720
Grandmother!

28:42.720 --> 28:44.640
Master! Master!

28:44.640 --> 28:47.110
-Grandmother! Grandmother!
-Are you alright?

28:47.110 --> 28:48.510
Grandmother? Grandmother?

28:48.510 --> 28:49.480
Master!

28:58.720 --> 28:59.900
My Lord, please see clearly!

28:59.900 --> 29:01.540
I can testify.

29:01.560 --> 29:02.680
It was Master who found someone

29:02.680 --> 29:04.610
to pretend to be the Second Master.

29:05.510 --> 29:08.650
Every word
the Divine Constable said is true.

29:09.030 --> 29:11.160
But I didn't dare to say it.

29:11.310 --> 29:13.760
If I had, I would die.

29:13.920 --> 29:14.750
Oh no.

29:14.750 --> 29:15.610
He's poisoned.

29:18.160 --> 29:19.820
The hairpin must be poisoned.

29:22.880 --> 29:23.900
Master...

29:32.550 --> 29:34.110
He's dead!

29:35.550 --> 29:38.030
Ji Ada is dead!

29:38.550 --> 29:39.790
Ji Ada...

29:40.310 --> 29:41.160
It's karma.

29:41.880 --> 29:44.920
It's karma!

29:45.440 --> 29:46.240
Grandmother.

29:46.640 --> 29:47.440
Grandmother?

29:53.720 --> 29:55.310
My good grandson...

29:57.050 --> 29:58.160
Good boy...

30:01.160 --> 30:03.070
In my whole life,

30:04.550 --> 30:06.440
the one I let down the most

30:08.440 --> 30:10.310
is you.

30:22.070 --> 30:23.000
Grandmother...

30:26.750 --> 30:27.920
Grandmother!

30:31.440 --> 30:34.340
Don't leave me.

30:39.550 --> 30:40.920
Grandmother.

30:42.110 --> 30:43.480
Grandmother!

30:42.210 --> 30:46.000
[Gong's Ancestral Hall]

31:05.550 --> 31:06.310
Move!

31:12.000 --> 31:12.830
Stay here

31:12.850 --> 31:14.650
and wait for our lord's summons.

31:29.240 --> 31:30.030
Jiuying.

31:31.270 --> 31:33.070
I didn't expect we'd meet again.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.270
Xia Jiuying,

31:45.440 --> 31:46.750
you have been acquitted.

31:46.750 --> 31:47.680
Come with me.

31:50.160 --> 31:50.960
Jiuying,

31:51.310 --> 31:52.440
you can go out now.

31:52.750 --> 31:53.750
You can go now.

31:53.920 --> 31:54.750
Let's go.

31:54.750 --> 31:55.510
Go.

31:58.400 --> 31:59.110
Go now.

31:59.110 --> 31:59.750
Come on.

31:59.920 --> 32:00.720
Listen to him.

32:01.160 --> 32:01.810
Hurry up!

32:02.350 --> 32:03.270
Go!

32:04.920 --> 32:05.590
Go!

32:15.160 --> 32:15.830
Bye.

32:15.830 --> 32:16.550
Jiuying!

32:21.310 --> 32:22.640
Remember to think of me.

32:22.930 --> 32:24.010
Jiuying.

32:24.270 --> 32:25.920
If I weren't Gong Le,

32:26.150 --> 32:28.120
would I be like you,

32:28.550 --> 32:30.450
having a Wolfie as a friend?

32:30.880 --> 32:31.680
Hurry up!

32:32.200 --> 32:34.410
Wolfie is my friend.

32:34.790 --> 32:37.650
Gong Le is also my friend.

32:37.750 --> 32:39.960
Wolfie is your friend.

32:41.270 --> 32:43.830
Gong Le is also your friend.

33:19.240 --> 33:20.030
Jiuying.

33:20.680 --> 33:22.810
Are you still wearing the gold pendant

33:22.880 --> 33:24.160
Mr. Ji gave you?

33:24.790 --> 33:26.440
Since we are friends now,

33:27.880 --> 33:29.270
give it to me.
